
Installation
------------

1. Download the .keylayout files.
2. Save the files to the Keyboard Layouts folder. You can do this by opening the file, and selecting File -> Install, or running the following on the command line:

    $ cp xal-mng.keylayout ~/Library/Keyboard\ Layouts/
    $ cp xal-rus.keylayout ~/Library/Keyboard\ Layouts/
    $ cp xal-phonetic.keylayout ~/Library/Keyboard\ Layouts/

3. Go to System Settings -> Keyboard -> Input Sources. Click the + button, and add **Kalmyk (Mongolia)** and/or **Kalmyk (Russia)** (and phonetic, if you want it).
